    {
      "id": "claim_af62f89c21fa48b28a001a18b2758329",
      "statement": "The convenience module exposes six high-level helper functions: is_grounded, is_hallucinated, check_groundedness, annotate_answer, format_with_citations, and get_citation_summary. All six are re-exported from the top-level cite_right package.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cite_right/__init__.py#L12-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9a3633085ccd66a418044574cce1a5340842a5d518de5ddc97c5ce0211acaeca:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cite_right/convenience.py#L1-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:058557a6ee8f3c1ff6e45bc3ef07a9233e11d11948f24fd74b6658042aa5bcba:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e40dede5caf14f27be5b713f6cf2b8b3",
      "statement": "is_grounded() returns True when metrics.groundedness_score >= threshold and False otherwise. The default threshold is 0.5, meaning at least 50% of the answer (by character count) must be grounded.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cite_right/convenience.py#L23-L71",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c87c4c084aa2355f778a34fc76858ef22c7f7bdc6ee91963664903e0b29e6c91:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4de99d7dac06451ba1de922ad0265cb2",
      "statement": "is_hallucinated() returns True when metrics.hallucination_rate > threshold and False otherwise. The default threshold is 0.5, flagging answers where more than 50% of content lacks grounding evidence.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cite_right/convenience.py#L74-L120",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:da0b6631b68e1f8d2909252efa9c76ce36b3d042c5b850e31407bde4dfc3d7d9:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_04a72e2f3587438abaed4bc908dc97d0",
      "statement": "The hallucination_rate equals 1.0 minus the groundedness_score, making is_grounded and is_hallucinated complementary inverses for threshold values in the open interval (0, 1).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cite_right/hallucination.py#L88-L90",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f7a5aa9a682b1c3adb0ab077585c21da8899e12217a82ca30de3eaf263e89880:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1c3c7a887c314ddb9d742b8b068d17d6",
      "statement": "The groundedness_score is computed as a weighted average of per-span confidence values by character count. Confidence for each span derives from its top-ranked citation's answer_coverage component; spans with no citations contribute 0.0.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cite_right/hallucination.py#L189-L212",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9c2123c51bb20efbb2d1ba9887209c3ec98e9ee633fea89c73671e4685f525dc:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cite_right/hallucination.py#L231-L249",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:19e1d1301cc482f93c307bb6ca903d603e20270bfa9dca73470d7d08e3e10dec:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4a7c1794822a4c3f87ec8ef2cbcc522b",
      "statement": "When HallucinationConfig.include_partial_in_grounded is True (the default), partial-status spans count toward the grounded score weighted by their coverage confidence; when False, partial spans contribute 0 and only supported spans count as grounded.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cite_right/hallucination.py#L214-L229",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3a222acc63d01d0024c7472adf60dfd18cc833a191d46bb698811a05fdeb301a:"
